<title>UK: Japanese stocks in London quiet due to holiday.</title>
<headline>Japanese stocks in London quiet due to holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese stocks in London were little changed on Tuesday with trade subdued by a market holiday in Japan, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;With the Tokyo market closed it has been very quiet indeed. Nothing's moved,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>The Nikkei 50 index in London was down just 1.05 points, or 0.08 percent, at 1,375.92 by 1504 GMT.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
